Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is truly a story hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but that cheeky man,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,before facing Her Majesty, the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually proposed marriage to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,without paying mind to such nonsense,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,threw herself into battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is easy to laugh at that foolish Balakzar,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he possessed the Crimson Dofus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There are six Dragon Eggs in the world \Ndesired by Her Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and four of those eggs, \Nare already gathered in this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we obtain the Crimson Dofus,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.98,0:02:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,there will be only one left!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That Balakzar used magic, \Nswung a flaming sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.90,0:02:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and made rain of stones fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, our Queen thrashed him completely\Nin an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mighty Queen, we praise your courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,, Gribas,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.53,0:02:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you for your loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:03:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It will soon be 15 years since Her Majesty Zabel\Nascended to the throne of both Bonta and Amakna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Regarding the 15th anniversary celebration,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,let us hear a few words from Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.51,0:03:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, you have served me well \Nin our battles up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,To celebrate this victory, 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the entire kingdom shall hold a grand ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, ladies and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Polish your armor, and tailor your finest dresses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.23,0:03:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,For a whole month, let us celebrate with joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.65,0:03:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Canel...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:04:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The noise from the banquet was too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gribas intends to talk about our achievements all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that was just a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go to Breshka Village and make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who stands in your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the only one I can rely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, you have General Gribas and Azalar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They would do anything you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent Azalar to Breshka Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To Breshka?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:04:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shedar,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.51,0:05:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the vision you saw might be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone is targeting me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving it to Azalar is the best course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,To rule a kingdom, one is sometimes \Nforced to make difficult decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You too must understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Difficult decisions...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,People of Breshka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.09,0:05:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of harming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There is something I wish to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, keep quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, it's just an ugly beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, and do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The honey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you save one for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the messenger of Queen Zabel,\Nthe great ruler of Bonta and Amakna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is, the Queen is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Among you, is there a youth \Nwith clear blue eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the royal color.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where that person is,\Nand I shall leave at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes are...\NA perfect blue...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That witch finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,found me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I am truly sorry for hiding such \Nan important secret from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no other way...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:07:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You always told me that Welsh \Nwas an orphan just like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That part is true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said you didn't know my parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to argue! 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I did until now was to protect you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we aren't related by blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you are my child!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to be devoured by flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me where the child is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my number one customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You praised my cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You used it as a sauce for your finest dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chabichou...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're far too romantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.43,0:08:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, we have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.19,0:08:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You rotten beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oho, look who we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasting my kindness like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't General Marmiton!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've fallen quite far, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those scales that used to shine so brightly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,are now a shadow of their former self.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To think someone as proud as you \Ncould become this rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because you spent so much time \Nby that witch Zabel's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you've stayed in the kitchen too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,General Marmiton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've grown quite fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if you are here, it means Her Majesty's intuition \Nwas correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In this village,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.81,0:09:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the heir of Canel Sheran Sharm is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tearing that child's tiny heart apart \Nwith these claws... is only a matter of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:10:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the smell of sweat and fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you show me your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the same eyes as his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly the heir of Bonta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you, young Welsh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.16,0:10:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no place for you in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you lay a finger on this child!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, nicely done, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You rude fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh! \N\Becha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mama is going to be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You dummy, what are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold back this big guy for much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, General?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.07,0:11:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Playtime is over. Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should I devour first, General?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,son of Canel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,WELSH!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No one should be able to resist my flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You call this flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joris!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Azalar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Is he shrinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing you, you were hiding somewhere \Nschemeing something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Zabel continues to threaten this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will keep getting in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.82,0:13:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So we are fated to fight, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would come back to your senses,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,there would be no need to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I am reborn, \Nthat is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.07,0:13:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.59,0:14:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed up, Azalar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't a human form much easier to move around in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Carelessness is a great enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no absolutes in battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the children and run, Joris!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,At the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I go, or should I not...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Joris, return that child!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot about me, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your center of gravity firm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the middle of receiving a pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Khan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.66,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oho, my little friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Joris!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon came to Breshka...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,those clear blue eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,those are the eyes of a Sheran Sharm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce Welsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The son of Canel and Anette.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The rightful heir to Bonta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehhh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome. \NWe are delighted to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't kneel to someone like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.88,0:17:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.70,0:18:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I'm managing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Khan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been getting worse lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad tries to hide it, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, your sandals...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,they don't just smell like feet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,,This is the true scent of Gobballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My head still hurts a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joris,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened to Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.05,0:18:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,General Marmiton fought for you until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she considered it an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,General Marmiton...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means I've been lied to my whole life,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do not think ill of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a proper reason,\Nto conceal Your Highness's lineage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.85,0:19:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Mama died?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What reason could be that important?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the rightful heir to Bonta.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Welsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone, Joris.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.31,0:19:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When Welsh looks like that,\Nthere's no talking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The best way for Welsh to calm down \Nis by cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please,forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mama saw this, she'd be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule number one of a good chef is \Nto keep the kitchen clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Becha, you know Mama could cook any dish, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But what Mama loved were simple dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.43,0:20:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's specialty was the omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.63,0:20:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but people think it's a pretty tough dish to master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.70,0:20:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you learn how to make a delicious omelet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama could make a thousand different types of omelets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The one I like best is with cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.87,0:20:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Becha, could you cut the lettuce?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:20:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.99,0:21:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it smells so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.03,0:21:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.11,0:21:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This smells like cream, cheese,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and a bit like your sandals!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.79,0:21:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got quite a sense of humor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.74,0:21:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so the Prince of Bonta is a cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And not just any cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides Mama, there's no cook in Breshka,\Nwho can match Welsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there are some old ladies good at dishes\Nthat I can't make, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, mealtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.15,0:21:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was little, the kitchen always smelled like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss the times when your Mother was around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joris,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.43,0:22:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,please tell me everything that I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,after this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.75,0:22:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.79,0:22:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(100,251.733)\c&HFFFFFF&\2c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&HFFFFFF&\b1\fs25}EP02   Cheese Omelet
